      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just updated the sdk today.  An avatar that I am currently working on, which is 37,210 quads in total, is currently being reported as having 124,030 triangles by the sdk, regardless of whether or not I select \"keep quads\".  I don't know how vrchat is even coming up with these numbers, but as a creator this is extremely frustrating.  I actively try to keep my content optimized, this avatar would otherwise be ranked medium, but this bug keeps pushing my content up to very poor, alongside hobbled together messes that don't even make the effort :/",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
