      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As an update to my observations, it seems like once uploaded, the triangle count appears to be accurate (and is showing the triangle, not quads count, even when \"keep quads\" is selected).  Just my observation but maybe this is only on the sdk side?  why's the count in the sdk not reflective of what's known when uploaded?  Maybe this was fixed on the server side at some point, since I know that wasn't the case in the past, but the sdk is still broken.",
